{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-01_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-01","title":"僵局","storyCode":"6-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c9f6e7165d63041e1647b2763b01c9a9370c77d1be3fd1affa5ce1d986aac415","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"937年\n埃里克勋爵与匹斯堡议会大学李尔兰·D教授于城邦史标准论刊（《我们从哪里来？》，44期）发表了合著论文。\n论文声称，据多具已风化遗骸的鉴定结果。\n萨尔贡四号填埋窟的考察已得出关键性结论，即感染者的隔离和处决无疑与实在法同源。\n......\n综上所述，感染者受难的历史，自法律出现的时候就已经开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_f"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门，基础支撑层，出口"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你们要和我战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们战胜我，有人能够侥幸活着——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意加入罗德岛，依你们的想法去对抗感染者共同的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是我必须承担的责任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:50AM  龙门夺回近卫局大楼4小时后 近铜钟出口处"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门近卫局 暨 罗德岛制药公司\n龙门围剿行动 最后环节\n1：控制整合运动在龙门中的行动范围。由龙门近卫局主导完成。\n2：消灭龙门中残余的整合运动小队。由龙门近卫局主导完成。\n3：保证消灭整合运动行动指挥官或使其彻底失去影响力。由龙门近卫局主导完成。\n4：在整合运动撤入贫民区之前，消灭整合运动。由龙门近卫局与罗德岛合作完成。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“......请各位市民注意......正在进行疏散演习......”\n“......没有随行动指示进行避难的市民，请锁紧门窗，拉好窗帘，不要随意走出家门......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把那个无人机射下来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就只是个演习对象而已？居然想用这种把戏这种说辞，把我辛苦制造出的恐怖完全掩盖掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"还敢用龙门语播一遍，乌萨斯语播一遍，又播一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"别被无人机干扰，走，都走！快点，避开主干道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"侦查小队三号也没消息了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"突，突击手的信号都消失了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"外围保障小队的联络通道在一个接一个地断线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可恨，可恶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这种侮辱......这是对整合运动的羞辱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样，怎么会这样？该死的龙门，该死的龙门人！该死的非感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（我从没见过他这样，他似乎很不安。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（浮士德，我们还有机会撤离吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（我给你们创造空间。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果对手只有普通警力和龙门近卫局，以及罗德岛，我们一定能安全撤退。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（什么意思？你是说，除了这些还有别的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"烦死了......烦死了！根本说不通！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"跟不上我指挥的队伍，我要怎么样才能赢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（有人在监视我们。这座城市里有其它东西。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（做好准备，为了生存。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（明白。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（......浮士德。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（我们相信你。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:20AM 近龙门近卫局某处 罗德岛行动小队预计巡逻点"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这种事情居然也要感染者去做？罗德岛这回还真是接了个恶毒的活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龙门。哼，龙门，这么大的城市怎么可能没有自己对抗入侵势力的手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让感染者协助普通人对抗感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了，反正也不是第一次了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快点干掉拦路的！身后的别管，突破他们的防御就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"只要穿过这条街，我们就有机会和第二大队汇合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"别给他们反击的机会，我们已经不剩下多少人了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在不剩下多少人，一会儿可就一个都不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......什么人！从天上掉下来了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"退后，都退后！她可能......她可能会飞行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个真不会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"识别码！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你用仪器扫一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（不好意思，我先和他们说点事！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门警员，听好！我是罗德岛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"别射击，我没心思再边打架边处理流矢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这里交给我一个人就行，你们赶紧去下处封锁点吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，现在来解决我们这边的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这个女人什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我解释一下你们应该就懂了，大概？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来自罗德岛的精英干员，煌。我的作战目标是让各位失去战斗能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不管各位是抱着什么样的心态入侵他国城邦，我们都只以解除各位的武装为首要目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不论各位对他人人身造成的伤害、损失以及事后的刑罚，至少，各位现在的抵抗没有任何意义。放下武器，你们还有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什么？你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"同是感染者，给你们一条路选吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻投降的话，我有资格抓你们去罗德岛，然后丢去个对感染者还算宽容的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"赤手空拳就挡下来了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你们反抗了，我就没什么话可说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们难道就该乖乖被你抓住吗？你有毛病吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没有！反抗是正当的，逃跑也是，这我完全赞成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过当你们开始反抗，我就必须用暴力回应你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"要么这样吧，我不用电锯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，真不想对同胞动手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......龙门的天气好潮湿啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这只傻猫......在施术！她的身上在冒热气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身上冒热气？猜错了。再猜猜看，是我身边的空气更热，还是你身边的空气更热？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"一起洗个萨米澡吧，我请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["警员"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["整合运动成员","煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
